  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that singleprofile multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, and weighted fusion achieve the highest accuracy (0.5399). This experiment tests replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt while keeping other settings identical, isolating the effect of the RNA encoder choice. It balances exploration of alternative encoders against exploitation of the current best configuration, addressing uncertainty about whether more complex encoders improve performance."
